msgid "Game embedding"
msgstr "遊戲嵌入"

msgid ""
"Godot supports optionally running the game in the editor itself. This is "
"enabled by default."
msgstr "Godot 支援（可選地）在編輯器內部直接執行遊戲。此功能預設處於啟用狀態。"

msgid ""
"The game always runs in a separate process, no matter the embedding mode "
"used. This means that if the game crashes, it will not crash the editor."
msgstr ""
"遊戲始終在獨立的處理程序中執行，無論使用何種嵌入模式。這意味著，如果遊戲崩"
"潰，編輯器不會隨之崩潰。"

msgid "Configuring game embedding"
msgstr "設定遊戲嵌入"

msgid "Game embedding can be in one of 3 states:"
msgstr "遊戲嵌入可以處於以下三種狀態之一："

msgid ""
"**Floating window** *(default)*: The game runs in a separate window, with a "
"Game bar at the top that allows you to adjust settings and select nodes in "
"the embedded game. Clicking the :button:`Game` main screen button focuses "
"the floating window."
msgstr ""
"**浮動視窗** *(預設)*： 遊戲將在一個獨立的視窗中執行，視窗頂部會顯示一個“遊戲"
"欄”（Game bar），允許你調整設定並在嵌入式遊戲中選擇節點。點擊主螢幕上"
"的 :button:`Game` 按鈕可使浮動視窗獲得焦點。"

msgid ""
"**Main window:** The game runs in the editor, with a Game bar at the top "
"that allows you to adjust settings and select nodes in the embedded game. "
"Clicking the :button:`Game` main screen button switches to the tab with the "
"running project."
msgstr ""
"**主視窗：** 遊戲將在編輯器內部執行，頂部會顯示一個“遊戲欄”（Game bar），允許"
"你調整設定並在嵌入式遊戲中選擇節點。點擊主螢幕上的 :button:`Game` 將切換到包"
"含正在執行專案的分頁。"

msgid ""
"**Disabled:** The game runs in a separate window, as if it was an exported "
"project. The Game bar at the top is not present; selecting nodes in the "
"embedded game is not possible."
msgstr ""
"**停用：** 遊戲將在一個獨立的視窗中執行，就像執行匯出的專案一樣。頂部不會顯示"
"“遊戲欄”（Game bar），也無法在嵌入式遊戲中選擇節點。"

msgid ""
"To configure this functionality, click the Game main screen at the top of "
"the editor:"
msgstr "要設定此功能，請按一下編輯器頂部的 Game（遊戲） 主螢幕按鈕："

msgid "Accessing the Game embedding main screen"
msgstr "存取遊戲嵌入主螢幕"

msgid ""
"Once on the Game main screen, click the dropdown menu in the top-right "
"corner of the Game bar:"
msgstr "進入‘遊戲（Game）’主介面後，點擊遊戲欄右上角的下拉選單："

msgid "Game embedding mode dropdown"
msgstr "遊戲嵌入模式下拉選單"

msgid "Two options are available to configure the game embedding mode:"
msgstr "有兩種選項可用於設定遊戲嵌入模式："

msgid ""
"**Embed Game on Next Play:** If enabled, game embedding is enabled and the "
"Game bar is available for use on the running game."
msgstr ""
"**下次執行遊戲時嵌入：** 如果啟用，將開啟遊戲嵌入模式，並且可以在執行的遊戲上"
"使用遊戲欄（Game bar）。"

msgid ""
"**Make Window Floating on Next Play:** If enabled, the game runs in a "
"floating window. If disabled, the game runs in the main editor window."
msgstr ""
"**下次執行遊戲時使視窗浮動：** 如果啟用，遊戲將在一個浮動視窗中執行。如果停"
"用，遊戲將在編輯器的主視窗中執行。"

msgid "Embedded window sizing"
msgstr "嵌入式視窗尺寸"

msgid ""
"As seen in the dropdown menu on the right of the Game bar, there are several "
"choices available to configure the embedded window size behavior. This "
"affects both the floating and main window embedding modes:"
msgstr ""
"正如遊戲欄右側下拉選單中所示，有多種選項可用於設定嵌入式視窗的尺寸行為。這既"
"影響浮動視窗模式，也影響主視窗嵌入模式："

msgid ""
"**Fixed Size** *(default)*: Set the viewport size to a fixed resolution, as "
"configured in the Project Settings. If both :ref:`display/window/size/"
"window_width_override<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"window_width_override>` and :ref:`display/window/size/"
"window_height_override<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"window_height_override>` are set above ``0``, this override is used instead."
msgstr ""
"**固定尺寸** *(預設)*：將視埠大小設定為專案設定中設定的固定解析度。如果同時設"
"定了 :ref:`display/window/size/"
"window_width_override<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"window_width_override>` 和 :ref:`display/window/size/"
"window_height_override<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"window_height_override>` 且數值均大於 ``0`` ，則會優先使用此覆蓋設定。"

msgid ""
"**Keep Aspect Ratio:** The viewport size stretches to match the game window "
"size, but always follows the aspect ratio defined by the ``width / height`` "
"as configured in the Project Settings."
msgstr ""
"**保持寬高比：** 視埠尺寸會拉伸以匹配遊戲視窗的大小，但始終遵循專案設定中設定"
"的 ``寬度 / 高度`` 所定義的寬高比。"

msgid ""
"**Stretch to Fit**: The viewport size stretches to match the game window "
"size, and may use an aspect ratio different than the one defined by the "
"``width / height`` as configured in the Project Settings. This matches the "
"behavior when game embedding is disabled."
msgstr ""
"**拉伸以適應：** 視埠尺寸會拉伸以匹配遊戲視窗的大小，並且可能會使用與專案設定"
"中設定的 ``寬度 / 高度`` 所定義的寬高比不同的比例。這與停用遊戲嵌入時的行為一"
"致。"

msgid "These options have no effect when game embedding is disabled."
msgstr "如果遊戲嵌入功能處於停用狀態，這些選項將不會生效。"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

msgid ""
"When game embedding is enabled, several features can be adjusted while the "
"project is running using the Game bar at the top."
msgstr ""
"啟用遊戲嵌入後，在專案執行時，可以使用頂部的“遊戲欄”（Game bar）來調整多項功"
"能。"

msgid "Game bar at the top of the embedded game window"
msgstr "嵌入式遊戲視窗頂部的遊戲欄"

msgid "In order from left to right:"
msgstr "從左到右依次是："

msgid "Pause (F9)"
msgstr "暫停 (F9)"

msgid ""
"Pauses/resumes the game. When paused, the game will stop processing physics "
"and idle frames, but it will still render and process input. This allows you "
"to :ref:`select nodes in the scene <doc_game_embedding_interaction_mode>` "
"and inspect their properties in the editor inspector while the game is "
"running."
msgstr ""
"暫停/恢復遊戲。當遊戲暫停時，將停止處理物理運算和空閒影格，但仍會繼續渲染畫面"
"並處理輸入。這允許你在遊戲執行時 :ref:`選擇場景中的節點 "
"<doc_game_embedding_interaction_mode>` 並在編輯器屬性檢視器中檢查其屬性。"

msgid "Frame advance (F10)"
msgstr "逐影格前進 (F10)"

msgid ""
"Only available when the game is paused. Advances the game by one frame, "
"allowing you to inspect the state of the game at a specific moment in time. "
"This can be used to diagnose short-lived interactions (such as collisions) "
"that are hard to inspect when the game is running at full speed."
msgstr ""
"僅在遊戲暫停時可用。該功能將遊戲向前推進一影格，允許你檢查遊戲在特定時刻的狀"
"態。這可用於診斷那些在遊戲全速執行時難以觀察的短暫互動（例如碰撞）。"

msgid "Game speed"
msgstr "遊戲速度"

msgid ""
"This option is a menu that can adjust the game speed. If the game "
"sets :ref:`Engine.time_scale <class_Engine_property_time_scale>` at runtime, "
"it will be multiplied by the value set here."
msgstr ""
"遊戲速度：該選項是一個可以調整遊戲速度的選單。如果遊戲在執行時設定"
"了 :ref:`Engine.time_scale <class_Engine_property_time_scale>`，其值將會與此"
"處設定的值相乘。"

msgid "Game speed dropdown on the left of the Game bar"
msgstr "遊戲欄左側的遊戲速度下拉選單"

msgid ""
"This can be used to view interactions in slow motion, or speed up the game "
"significantly to test mechanics that normally take a long time to occur."
msgstr ""
"這既可以用來慢動作查看互動細節，也能大幅加快遊戲速度，方便測試那些通常需要很"
"久才會觸發的機制。"

msgid ""
"The reset button to the right of the dropdown resets the game speed to "
"normal (1.0×)."
msgstr "下拉選單右側的重設按鈕，可以將遊戲速度恢復到正常（1.0倍）。"

msgid ""
"When adjusting the game speed using this mechanism, the physics tick rate "
"(determined by the :ref:`physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second>` "
"project setting) is automatically multiplied by the game speed. This allows "
"the game logic to run at a different speed without affecting the physics "
"simulation. For example:"
msgstr ""
"當使用此機制調整遊戲速度時，物理更新頻率（由專案設定中的 :ref:`physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second <class_ProjectSettings_property_physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second>` 決定）會自動乘以目前的遊戲速度。這樣一來，"
"遊戲邏輯的執行速度可以發生變化，而不會影響物理模擬的準確性。例如："

msgid "If you set the game speed to 0.5, the physics tick rate is halved."
msgstr "如果你將遊戲速度設為 0.5，那麼物理引擎的刷新頻率也會減半。"

msgid "If you set the game speed to 4.0, the physics tick rate is quadrupled."
msgstr "如果你將遊戲速度設為 4.0，那麼物理引擎的刷新頻率也會變成原來的四倍。"

msgid ""
"The :ref:`maximum number of physics steps per frame "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame>` "
"is also increased to match the new physics tick rate, but it will not "
"decrease below the default value when running in slow motion."
msgstr ""
"每影格的最大物理步數（由 :ref:`maximum number of physics steps per frame "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame>` "
"決定）也會相應增加，以匹配新的物理刷新率；不過，當遊戲處於慢動作狀態時，這個"
"數值不會降低到預設值以下。"

msgid "Interaction mode"
msgstr "互動模式"

msgid ""
"This controls the behavior when clicking or pressing keys while the embedded "
"game window has focus."
msgstr ""
"這決定了當嵌入式遊戲視窗處於焦點狀態時，點擊滑鼠或按下按鍵會觸發甚麼行為。"

msgid "**Input** *(default)*: Allow game input as usual."
msgstr "**輸入** *（預設）*：照常允許遊戲接收輸入。"

msgid ""
"**2D:** Disable game input and allow selecting Node2Ds, Controls, and "
"manipulating the 2D camera."
msgstr "**2D：** 停用遊戲輸入，允許選擇 Node2D、Control，並操控 2D 攝影機。"

msgid ""
"**3D:** Disable game input and allow selecting Node3Ds and manipulating the "
"3D camera."
msgstr "**3D：** 停用遊戲輸入，允許選擇 Node3D，並操控 3D 攝影機。"

msgid ""
"Nodes that are selected in the 2D and 3D modes can be inspected in the "
"editor's inspector, just like if they were selected in the editor. This "
"allows you to inspect and modify properties of nodes in the running game."
msgstr ""
"在 2D 和 3D 模式下選中的節點，都可以像平時在編輯器里選中它們一樣，在編輯器的"
"‘屬性檢視器’（Inspector）面板中查看。這意味著你可以直接查看並修改正在執行中的"
"遊戲里的節點屬性。"

msgid ""
"Like in the Remote scene tree, changes made to the running game this way are "
"not preserved when the game is stopped."
msgstr ""
"就像在‘遠端場景樹’（Remote scene tree）中一樣，以這種方式對正在執行的遊戲所做"
"的更改，在遊戲停止時不會被保留。"

msgid ""
"To make changes that are preserved after stopping the game, you need to "
"select the nodes in the editor's Local scene tree and modify them from there "
"while the game is running instead. Make sure :menu:`Debug > Synchronize "
"Scene Changes` is enabled when doing this."
msgstr ""
"如果想要在遊戲停止後依然保留所做的更改，你需要在編輯器的‘本機場景樹’（Local "
"scene tree）中選中對應的節點，並在遊戲執行時從那裡進行修改。進行此操作時，請"
"確保 :menu:`Debug > Synchronize Scene Changes` 處於開啟狀態。"

msgid "Select mode"
msgstr "選取模式"

msgid "*Only effective if the interaction mode is 2D or 3D, not Input.*"
msgstr "*僅在互動模式為 2D 或 3D 時有效，在 Input（輸入）模式下無效。*"

msgid ""
"When enabling this option, the \"show list of selectable nodes at position "
"clicked\" mode is disabled. However, you can still perform this action in "
"select mode by using :kbd:`Ctrl + Alt + Right mouse button` at the desired "
"location."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，‘在點擊位置顯示可選節點清單’的模式將被停用。不過，你依然可以在"
"選擇模式下，通過在目標位置按下 :kbd:`Ctrl + Alt + Right mouse button` 來執行"
"此操作。"

msgid "Show list of selectable nodes at position clicked"
msgstr "顯示在點擊位置的可選節點列表"

msgid ""
"Like in the editor, this shows a list of selectable nodes at the position "
"clicked. This is useful when multiple nodes are overlapping and you want to "
"select a specific one. When enabling this option, select mode is disabled."
msgstr ""
"和在編輯器中相似，這會在點擊位置顯示一個可選節點列表。此功能在你想要從多個重"
"疊的節點裡選擇其中一個時十分實用。啟用此選項時，選擇模式會被停用。"

msgid "Toggle selection visibility"
msgstr "切換選中項的可見性"

msgid ""
"By default, the selected node in 2D or 3D interaction mode is highlighted "
"with an orange rectangle or box (like in the editor)."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，在 2D 或 3D 互動模式中，被選中的節點會像在遊戲編輯器里一樣，被一"
"個橙色的矩形或方框醒目標示顯示出來。"

msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, it appears as a closed eye icon. Future "
"selections will not be highlighted in the game view, but are still selected "
"for inspection in the inspector. This is useful to avoid visual clutter."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，它會顯示為一個閉合的眼睛圖示。此後，你在遊戲檢視中選中的物體將"
"不再顯示醒目標示框，但它們依然會被選中，並且可以在右側的‘屬性檢視器’"
"（Inspector）面板中查看屬性。這個功能非常實用，可以避免畫面看起來過於雜亂。"

msgid "Selection advanced options"
msgstr "進階選擇選項"

msgid ""
"Two advanced options are available in the dropdown menu next to the select "
"mode icons:"
msgstr "在‘選擇模式’圖示旁邊的下拉選單中，提供了兩個進階選項："

msgid ""
"**Don't Select Locked Nodes:** When enabled, nodes that are locked in the "
"editor cannot be selected. This mimics editor behavior."
msgstr ""
"**不選中已鎖定的節點：** 啟用後，在編輯器中被鎖定的節點將無法被選中。這完美復"
"刻了編輯器原本的操作邏輯。"

msgid ""
"**Select Group over Children:** When enabled, grouped nodes are selected "
"instead of their individual children. This mimics editor behavior."
msgstr ""
"**優先選中組而非子節點：** 啟用後，點擊時會直接選中整個節點組，而不是組內的單"
"個子節點。這完美復刻了編輯器原本的操作邏輯。"

msgid "Mute game audio"
msgstr "靜音遊戲音訊"

msgid ""
"This mutes game audio when enabled, without affecting the editor or other "
"applications. This is particularly useful on macOS and Android, which do not "
"come with a per-application volume slider out of the box."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，會直接靜音遊戲發出的音訊，但不會影響編輯器本身或其他應用程式的"
"聲音。這個功能在 macOS 和 Android 平台上特別實用，因為這兩個系統預設並沒有提"
"供針對單個應用程式的獨立音量調節滑塊。"

msgid "Camera override"
msgstr "相機覆蓋"

msgid ""
"When enabled, the camera stops following the game camera. You can then move "
"the 2D/3D camera freely by switching to the 2D/3D interaction mode and using "
"the typical navigation controls:"
msgstr ""
"啟用後，預覽相機會停止跟隨遊戲內的相機。之後，你只需切換到 2D 或 3D 互動模"
"式，並使用常規的導航操作，就能自由地移動預覽視角了。"

msgid ""
"In the 2D interaction mode, use the middle mouse button (or :kbd:`Space + "
"Left mouse button`) to pan around and the mouse wheel to zoom."
msgstr ""
"在 2D 互動模式下，按住滑鼠中鍵（或者 :kbd:`Space + Left mouse button`）可以平"
"移視角，捲動滑鼠滾輪則可以進行縮放。"

msgid ""
"In the 3D interaction mode, hold the right mouse button and "
"press :kbd:`W`, :kbd:`A`, :kbd:`S`, and :kbd:`D` to use freelook. Use the "
"middle mouse button to orbit, :kbd:`Shift + Middle mouse button` to pan, and "
"the mouse wheel to zoom. Additionally, you can use :kbd:`Ctrl + "
"Minus`, :kbd:`Ctrl + Plus`, and :kbd:`Ctrl + 0` to control the field of view "
"(relative to the game's own camera FOV)."
msgstr ""
"在 3D 互動模式下，按住滑鼠右鍵，同時按下 :kbd:`W`, :kbd:`A`, :kbd:`S`, "
"and :kbd:`D` 鍵即可自由觀察（freelook）。使用滑鼠中鍵可以圍繞目標旋轉視角，按"
"住 :kbd:`Shift + Middle mouse button` 鍵可以平移視角，捲動滑鼠滾輪則可以進行"
"縮放。此外，你還可以使用 :kbd:`Ctrl + Minus` 、 :kbd:`Ctrl + Plus` 以"
"及 :kbd:`Ctrl + 0` 來調整視野範圍（FOV，這是相對於遊戲自帶相機的視野範圍而言"
"的）。"

msgid ""
"This is useful to inspect parts of the scene that are not visible from the "
"game camera's point of view, or to inspect the game camera itself. When the "
"camera override is disabled, the camera will snap back to the game camera's "
"point of view."
msgstr ""
"這個功能非常適合用來檢查那些從遊戲自帶相機視角根本看不到的場景區域，或者用來"
"直接觀察遊戲相機本身的位置和狀態。當你關閉‘相機覆蓋’（即退出自由觀察模式）"
"時，視角會立刻自動彈回並鎖定到遊戲相機的視角上。"

msgid ""
"When disabling camera override, the overridden camera's position and "
"rotation are not reset. This allows you to quickly toggle back and forth "
"between the game camera and the overridden camera."
msgstr ""
"當關閉‘相機覆蓋’（即退出自由觀察模式）時，被覆蓋的遊戲相機原本的位置和旋轉角"
"度並不會被重設。這樣一來，你就可以在遊戲相機和自由觀察視角之間快速地來回切換"
"了。"

msgid ""
"If the camera override appears to be non-interactive, make sure to be in the "
"2D or 3D interaction mode. The camera override will keep working while in "
"the Input interaction mode, but you won't be able to move the overridden "
"camera while in that mode (unless using the **Manipulate From Editors** "
"camera override mode as described below)."
msgstr ""
"如果‘相機覆蓋’（自由觀察模式）看起來無法互動，請確保你已經切換到了 2D 或 3D "
"互動模式。雖然在‘輸入互動模式’（Input interaction mode）下，相機覆蓋功能依然"
"保持開啟，但在這個模式下你無法移動被覆蓋的相機（除非使用下面提到的 **從編輯器"
"操縱** 這種相機覆蓋模式）。"

msgid ""
"When overriding the 2D/3D camera, the project's scripts are not aware of "
"this camera override. Keep this in mind when inspecting properties that "
"depend on the camera position, as they will account for the original camera "
"position instead."
msgstr ""
"當覆蓋 2D/3D 相機時，專案中的腳本並不會感知到這個相機覆蓋操作。因此，在檢查那"
"些取決於相機位置的屬性時，請務必記住：它們計算的依然是原始遊戲相機的位置，而"
"不是你目前自由觀察的位置。"

msgid "Camera override options"
msgstr "相機覆蓋 選項"

msgid ""
"**Reset 2D/3D Camera:** Resets the 2D/3D camera to the position and rotation "
"defined by the game. Note that the camera will still be frozen in place "
"until you disable camera override."
msgstr ""
"**重設 2D/3D 相機：** 將 2D/3D 相機重設回遊戲原本定義的位置和旋轉角度。不過請"
"注意，重設後相機依然會保持在原位鎖定不動，直到你徹底關閉‘相機覆蓋’（自由觀察"
"模式）為止。"

msgid ""
"**Manipulate In-Game** *(default)*: The camera override is controlled from "
"the game window. This allows controlling the camera without needing to "
"switch back to the editor."
msgstr ""
"**在遊戲中操縱** *（預設選項）*：開啟這個模式後，自由觀察（相機覆蓋）的操作將"
"直接在遊戲視窗中進行。這樣一來，你就不需要來回切換回編輯器介面，也能輕鬆控制"
"相機視角啦。"

msgid ""
"**Manipulate From Editors:** The camera override is controlled from the "
"editor window. This can be useful on multi-monitor setups where the editor "
"can be displayed side-by-side with the running project. Also, when using "
"this option, the camera override position can be remembered across project "
"runs, since it will reuse the editor camera position directly when enabled."
msgstr ""
"**從編輯器操縱：** 開啟這個選項後，自由觀察（相機覆蓋）的操作將完全在編輯器視"
"窗中進行。這個功能在多顯示器設定下特別實用，因為你可以把編輯器和正在執行的遊"
"戲專案並排顯示，一邊看遊戲畫面，一邊在編輯器里操控鏡頭。而且，當你使用這個選"
"項時，自由觀察的相機位置還能在多次執行專案之間被“記住”！因為每次開啟時，它都"
"會直接復用編輯器里相機原本的位置，完全不需要你每次都重新找角度啦。"

msgid ""
"The camera override may appear less smooth while using the **Manipulate From "
"Editors** camera override mode, as a result of using local network "
"communication between the editor and the game to update the camera position."
msgstr ""
"在使用 **從編輯器操縱** 這種相機覆蓋模式時，相機覆蓋的畫面看起來可能會不夠流"
"暢。這是因為編輯器和遊戲之間需要通過本機網路通信來同步更新相機的位置（從而產"
"生了一定的延遲）。"

msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

msgid "Game embedding has a number of limitations to be aware of:"
msgstr "請注意，遊戲嵌入功能存在一些已知的局限性（限制）："

msgid ""
"In the Android editor, game embedding always uses a floating window. By "
"default, the floating window is kept on top of the editor using Android's "
"picture-in-picture functionality. This behavior can be disabled in the Game "
"bar by unchecking :menu:`Keep on Top using PiP` in the menu on the right of "
"the Game bar."
msgstr ""
"在安卓（Android）編輯器中，遊戲嵌入功能始終會使用浮動視窗來顯示。預設情況下，"
"系統會利用安卓自帶的“畫中畫”（PiP）功能，讓這個浮動視窗一直保持在編輯器的最上"
"層。如果你覺得這個設定有點礙事，可以在遊戲欄（Game bar）右側的選單中，取消勾"
"選 :menu:`Keep on Top using PiP` ，就能輕鬆關掉這個自動置頂的行為啦。"

msgid ""
"Window mode changes (e.g. fullscreen) are not supported when using game "
"embedding."
msgstr "在使用遊戲嵌入功能時，不支援更改視窗模式（比如切換到全螢幕模式）。"

msgid ""
"When :menu:`Debug > Customize Run Instances...` is used to enable running "
"with multiple instances, only the first instance will use game embedding. "
"Other instances will spawn in their own windows, without the Game bar at the "
"top."
msgstr ""
"當使用 :menu:`Debug > Customize Run Instances...` 功能來同時執行多個實例時，"
"只有第一個實例會使用遊戲嵌入（顯示在編輯器內）。其餘的實例則會彈出在各自獨立"
"的視窗中，並且這些視窗頂部不會帶有遊戲欄（Game bar）。"
